  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#event-loop-for-spec-authors\r\n\r\n> specification\\-level data structures and values from the WHATWG Infra Standard, as those are realm\\-agnostic\r\n\r\n\"specification\\-level\" and \"realm\\-agnostic\" in the above-quoted text are undefined AFAICT in grovelling through HTML, Infra, WebIDL.\r\n\r\nalso, perhaps \"data structures and values\" should be \"types and data structures\" ?\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n",
